              "text": "audācia, audāciae — \"boldness, daring\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Audācia nautae omnēs servat. The sailor's daring saves everyone."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine, first declension, from audāx. Often in a bad sense: recklessness, impudence. English audacity."
            }
          ]
        },
