              "text": "prūdentia, prūdentiae — \"good sense, prudence\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Prūdentiā patris familia servātur. The family is saved by the father's good sense."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine, first declension, from prūdēns, a short form of prōvidēns — foreseeing. English prudence."
            }
          ]
        },
